---
---

<section class="section thesis-new" id="thesis">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-tag">02 &mdash; Thesis</div>
    <h2 class="thesis-heading">Kami percaya <span>kesabaran</span> adalah aset yang paling jarang dimiliki di pasar.</h2>

    <div class="thesis-list">
      <div class="thesis-item reveal">
        <div class="thesis-item-text">
          <span class="thesis-num">01</span>
          <p>Bukan soal seberapa cepat modal bertumbuh, tapi seberapa lama ia bisa bertahan lewat siklus pasar yang berbeda-beda.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="thesis-mockup thesis-mockup-time shimmer-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" width="100%" height="100%">
            <text x="14" y="26" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="10" fill="#8C8C90">SIKLUS PASAR</text>
            <rect x="14" y="52" width="132" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#2A2A2D"></rect>
            <rect id="sliderFill" x="14" y="52" width="0" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#E8112D"></rect>
            <circle id="sliderDot" cx="14" cy="55.5" r="8" fill="#E8112D"></circle>
            <circle id="sliderRing" cx="14" cy="55.5" r="13" fill="none" stroke="#E8112D" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"></circle>
            <text x="14" y="86" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#5c5c60">Bearish</text>
            <text x="122" y="86" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#5c5c60">Bullish</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="thesis-item reveal">
        <div class="thesis-item-text">
          <span class="thesis-num">02</span>
          <p><strong>Capital Wawan dibangun di atas satu prinsip sederhana:</strong> uang bekerja paling baik ketika dikelola dengan data, bukan emosi. Saham domestik dan aset kripto bukan instrumen spekulasi jangka pendek, melainkan kelas aset yang dipelajari mendalam, dipegang dengan keyakinan, dievaluasi berkala.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="thesis-mockup thesis-mockup-data shimmer-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" width="100%" height="100%">
            <rect x="14" y="14" width="62" height="82" rx="10" fill="#1B1B1E" stroke="#2A2A2D"></rect>
            <text x="24" y="38" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#8C8C90">DATA</text>
            <text id="dataPct" x="24" y="66" font-family="Archivo Expanded, sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="800" fill="#F2F1EE">0%</text>
            <rect x="84" y="14" width="62" height="82" rx="10" fill="#1B1B1E" stroke="#2A2A2D" opacity="0.5"></rect>
            <text x="94" y="38" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#8C8C90" opacity="0.6">EMOSI</text>
            <text id="emosiPct" x="94" y="66" font-family="Archivo Expanded, sans-serif" font-size="20" font-weight="800" fill="#8C8C90" opacity="0.6">0%</text>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="thesis-item reveal">
        <div class="thesis-item-text">
          <span class="thesis-num">03</span>
          <p>Fokus kami ada pada perusahaan dan protokol dengan fundamental yang jelas emiten dengan model bisnis yang bisa dipertanggungjawabkan, atau jaringan blockchain dengan adopsi nyata. Kami tidak mengejar tren, kami mengevaluasi keduanya dengan standar yang sama ketatnya.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="thesis-mockup thesis-mockup-check shimmer-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" width="100%" height="100%">
            <rect x="14" y="14" width="132" height="20" rx="5" fill="#1B1B1E"></rect>
            <circle cx="27" cy="24" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#2A2A2D" stroke-width="1.5" class="check-ring" data-order="0"></circle>
            <path d="M23.8,24 L26.2,26.5 L31,20.5" stroke="#E8112D" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" class="check-mark" data-order="0"></path>
            <rect x="42" y="20" width="90" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#2A2A2D"></rect>
            <rect x="14" y="40" width="132" height="20" rx="5" fill="#1B1B1E"></rect>
            <circle cx="27" cy="50" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#2A2A2D" stroke-width="1.5" class="check-ring" data-order="1"></circle>
            <path d="M23.8,50 L26.2,52.5 L31,46.5" stroke="#E8112D" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" class="check-mark" data-order="1"></path>
            <rect x="42" y="46" width="90" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#2A2A2D"></rect>
            <rect x="14" y="66" width="132" height="20" rx="5" fill="#1B1B1E" opacity="0.5"></rect>
            <circle cx="27" cy="76" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#8C8C90" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
            <rect x="42" y="72" width="64" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="#2A2A2D"></rect>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="thesis-item reveal">
        <div class="thesis-item-text">
          <span class="thesis-num">04</span>
          <p><strong>Konsistensi, disiplin, dan percaya pada progres</strong> itu yang membangun portofolio ini, bukan jalan pintas. Setiap keputusan dievaluasi hari demi hari, bulan demi bulan, sampai hasilnya terlihat dalam hitungan tahun.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="thesis-mockup thesis-mockup-streak shimmer-card">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" width="100%" height="100%">
            <text x="14" y="24" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="9" fill="#8C8C90">CONSISTENCY STREAK</text>
            <g id="streakGrid"></g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  import { initThesisMockups } from "../scripts/thesisMockups";
  initThesisMockups();
</script>
